{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 438, "line_no": 2, "text": "依族村寨，几乎每寨都有一座“榭”。“榭”基本上修建在靠近村寨险要的山巅、山腰、洞穴", "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 257, "w": 1552, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "依族村寨，几乎每寨都有一座“榭”。“榭”基本上修建在靠近村寨险要的山巅、山腰、洞穴", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 257, "w": 1552, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 438, "line_no": 3, "text": "或水域之处。多数是一寨单独修建，也有少部分是两寨或多寨合修的。", "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 322, "w": 1234, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "或水域之处。多数是一寨单独修建，也有少部分是两寨或多寨合修的。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 322, "w": 1234, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 438, "line_no": 4, "text": "“榭”的功能主要是军事防御，因此所选地形都有易守难攻的特点。同时，“榭”也是", "bbox_px": {"x": 153, "y": 382, "w": 1471, "h": 61}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "“榭”的功能主要是军事防御，因此所选地形都有易守难攻的特点。同时，“榭”也是", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 153, "y": 382, "w": 1471, "h": 61}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 438, "line_no": 5, "text": "集体祭祀场所，许多村寨寨神庙就建在“榭”上。如有来犯之敌，先祭祀寨神，祈求寨神保", "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 451, "w": 1552, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "集体祭祀场所，许多村寨寨神庙就建在“榭”上。如有来犯之敌，先祭祀寨神，祈求寨神保", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 451, "w": 1552, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 438, "line_no": 6, "text": "佑，和平时期，则定期举行祭祀仪式，制定村规民约等。", "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 515, "w": 949, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "佑，和平时期，则定期举行祭祀仪式，制定村规民约等。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 515, "w": 949, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 438, "line_no": 7, "text": "村寨围墙也是一种防御性公共建筑。许多布依族村寨都砌有围墙，墻边种植霸王", "bbox_px": {"x": 157, "y": 579, "w": 1467, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "村寨围墙也是一种防御性公共建筑。许多布依族村寨都砌有围墙，墻边种植霸王", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 157, "y": 579, "w": 1467, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 438, "line_no": 8, "text": "鞭、黄刺花等荆棘。产大楠竹的地方周围栽一道楠竹护墙。村中一种基层社会组织，称", "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 652, "w": 1548, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "鞭、黄刺花等荆棘。产大楠竹的地方周围栽一道楠竹护墙。村中一种基层社会组织，称", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 652, "w": 1548, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 438, "line_no": 9, "text": "为“议各习”（类似议榔），一般在“三月三”祭社神时各寨群众聚集议事，商议保苗防盗措", "bbox_px": {"x": 80, "y": 712, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "为“议各习”（类似议榔），一般在“三月三”祭社神时各寨群众聚集议事，商议保苗防盗措", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 80, "y": 712, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 438, "line_no": 10, "text": "施，凡有紧急事情，以吹牛角为号，远近村寨闻声即来救援；有的则寨边有岩洞，有急警则", "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 776, "w": 1552, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "施，凡有紧急事情，以吹牛角为号，远近村寨闻声即来救援；有的则寨边有岩洞，有急警则", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 776, "w": 1552, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 438, "line_no": 11, "text": "将老幼妇孺进洞躲避，青壮年则在洞外防卫。", "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 845, "w": 780, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "将老幼妇孺进洞躲避，青壮年则在洞外防卫。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 845, "w": 780, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 438, "line_no": 12, "text": "第五节 建造信仰与禁忌", "bbox_px": {"x": 535, "y": 998, "w": 639, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "第五节 建造信仰与禁忌", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 535, "y": 998, "w": 639, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 438, "line_no": 13, "text": "布依族的房屋建造，有诸多的信仰与禁忌，其中，最为突出的就是风水观念的渗透，", "bbox_px": {"x": 161, "y": 1167, "w": 1467, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族的房屋建造，有诸多的信仰与禁忌，其中，最为突出的就是风水观念的渗透，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 161, "y": 1167, "w": 1467, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 438, "line_no": 14, "text": "以及其他繁复的规仪。由于布依族朴素的自然观注重人与自然的和谐统一，因此，在建", "bbox_px": {"x": 80, "y": 1231, "w": 1544, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "以及其他繁复的规仪。由于布依族朴素的自然观注重人与自然的和谐统一，因此，在建", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 80, "y": 1231, "w": 1544, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 438, "line_no": 15, "text": "造住宅建筑时，十分注重对自然地理环境的选择。传统的布依族住宅建筑一般都选在依", "bbox_px": {"x": 80, "y": 1291, "w": 1548, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "造住宅建筑时，十分注重对自然地理环境的选择。传统的布依族住宅建筑一般都选在依", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 80, "y": 1291, "w": 1548, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 438, "line_no": 16, "text": "山傍水向阳的山麓地带。后来随着汉民族向布依族地区大量迁入，汉文化中的风水观念", "bbox_px": {"x": 80, "y": 1356, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "山傍水向阳的山麓地带。后来随着汉民族向布依族地区大量迁入，汉文化中的风水观念", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 80, "y": 1356, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 438, "line_no": 17, "text": "也对布依族的住宅建筑产生了重大影响。汉族风水文化所追求的“天人合一”与“时空合", "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 1419, "w": 1540, "h": 62}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "也对布依族的住宅建筑产生了重大影响。汉族风水文化所追求的“天人合一”与“时空合", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 1419, "w": 1540, "h": 62}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 438, "line_no": 18, "text": "一”境界，与布依族朴素自然观所追求的人与自然和谐统一目标是密切相关的。", "bbox_px": {"x": 80, "y": 1489, "w": 1375, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "一”境界，与布依族朴素自然观所追求的人与自然和谐统一目标是密切相关的。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 80, "y": 1489, "w": 1375, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 438, "line_no": 19, "text": "布依族建房前，先请阴阳先生看“风水”，选择住宅基地，找好向山和靠山。宅基一般", "bbox_px": {"x": 161, "y": 1553, "w": 1463, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族建房前，先请阴阳先生看“风水”，选择住宅基地，找好向山和靠山。宅基一般", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 161, "y": 1553, "w": 1463, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 438, "line_no": 20, "text": "要依山傍水。向山要选择“二龙抢宝”", "bbox_px": {"x": 80, "y": 1617, "w": 671, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "要依山傍水。向山要选择“二龙抢宝”", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 80, "y": 1617, "w": 671, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 438, "line_no": 21, "text": "、“双龙戏珠”、“狮子滚绣球”、“万马归槽”", "bbox_px": {"x": 736, "y": 1617, "w": 764, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "、“双龙戏珠”、“狮子滚绣球”、“万马归槽”", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 736, "y": 1617, "w": 764, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 438, "line_no": 22, "text": "、“寿星", "bbox_px": {"x": 1492, "y": 1617, "w": 133, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.3, "blocks": [{"text": "、“寿星", "conf": 0.3, "bbox_px": {"x": 1492, "y": 1617, "w": 133, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 438, "line_no": 23, "text": "高照”等山势：靠山要靠那“卧狮拱卫”、“青龙环护”、“贵人坐椅”等山势。认为只有选好", "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 1678, "w": 1540, "h": 60}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "高照”等山势：靠山要靠那“卧狮拱卫”、“青龙环护”、“贵人坐椅”等山势。认为只有选好", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 1678, "w": 1540, "h": 60}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 438, "line_no": 24, "text": "风水、龙脉，才可以给家人带来吉利和幸福。选地基，必须按主人的年庚八字，结合地势，", "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 1750, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "风水、龙脉，才可以给家人带来吉利和幸福。选地基，必须按主人的年庚八字，结合地势，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 1750, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 438, "line_no": 25, "text": "通过推算，架罗盘定好房屋走向。然后主人请石匠，择吉日动土。", "bbox_px": {"x": 80, "y": 1810, "w": 1134, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "通过推算，架罗盘定好房屋走向。然后主人请石匠，择吉日动土。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 80, "y": 1810, "w": 1134, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 438, "line_no": 26, "text": "在建屋基的同时开始准备木料。布依族木匠，也尊鲁班为“祖师爷”。在开工和新居", "bbox_px": {"x": 165, "y": 1871, "w": 1463, "h": 60}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "在建屋基的同时开始准备木料。布依族木匠，也尊鲁班为“祖师爷”。在开工和新居", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 165, "y": 1871, "w": 1463, "h": 60}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 438, "line_no": 27, "text": "即将落成时都要举行祭祀仪式，祈求祖师爷保佑匠人和主人家平安。", "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 1939, "w": 1190, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "即将落成时都要举行祭祀仪式，祈求祖师爷保佑匠人和主人家平安。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 1939, "w": 1190, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 438, "line_no": 28, "text": "木工和石工完成之后，就要请木匠截树、刨柱、画墨、打眼、割榫。起房三日前用穿析", "bbox_px": {"x": 165, "y": 2008, "w": 1459, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "木工和石工完成之后，就要请木匠截树、刨柱、画墨、打眼、割榫。起房三日前用穿析", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 165, "y": 2008, "w": 1459, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 438, "line_no": 29, "text": "把柱头、瓜筒串连起来，排成四列（这是三间房，若起五间则有六列），名日“排扇”。此项", "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 2067, "w": 1540, "h": 66}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "把柱头、瓜筒串连起来，排成四列（这是三间房，若起五间则有六列），名日“排扇”。此项", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 2067, "w": 1540, "h": 66}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 438, "line_no": 30, "text": "工作必须在立房吉日前完成。待立房之日，木匠要先举行“掩煞”仪式，杀鸡祭祀，认为可", "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 2132, "w": 1540, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "工作必须在立房吉日前完成。待立房之日，木匠要先举行“掩煞”仪式，杀鸡祭祀，认为可", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 2132, "w": 1540, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 438, "line_no": 31, "text": "以驱邪。举行仪式时，木匠师傅将鸡血滴在新房周围，口念：", "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 2205, "w": 1041, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "以驱邪。举行仪式时，木匠师傅将鸡血滴在新房周围，口念：", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 2205, "w": 1041, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 438, "line_no": 32, "text": "“此鸡，此鸡，不是非凡鸡。", "bbox_px": {"x": 402, "y": 2265, "w": 466, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "“此鸡，此鸡，不是非凡鸡。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 402, "y": 2265, "w": 466, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 438, "line_no": 33, "text": "头顶红冠子，身穿五色衣。", "bbox_px": {"x": 414, "y": 2333, "w": 450, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "头顶红冠子，身穿五色衣。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 414, "y": 2333, "w": 450, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
